REGENT OF TEMANGGUNG

REGENT OF TEMANGGUNG

CENTRAL JAVA PROVINCE

REGIONAL REGULATION OF TEMANGGUNG REGENCY

NUMBER 14 OF 2020

CONCERNING

EMPOWERMENT AND PROTECTION OF WOMEN

BY THE GRACE OF ALMIGHTY GOD

THE REGENT OF TEMANGGUNG,

Considering : a. that every citizen has equal rights to live a dignified life in accordance with the principles of humanity, equality, and justice;

b. that the empowerment of women is carried out so that women can actualize their potential optimally to participate in development in accordance with their capacity;

c. that women who are vulnerable groups need special protection so that they do not experience violence and can live a decent life in accordance with the principles of humanity, equality and justice;

d. that based on the considerations as referred to in letter a, letter b, and letter c, it is necessary to establish a Regional Regulation on Empowerment and Protection

of Women;

